  "question": {
    "text": "The sum of all real values of <math><mi>x</mi></math> satisfying the equation <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is",
